## A note on working through these

Build and test one step before starting the next, since each relies on the previous ones. If the assistant produces too much at once, ask it to focus on a single screen or flow within the current step. If something in an earlier step needs to change once you reach a later one, update it and re-test the steps that depend on it. The full specification remains the reference for exact field names, rules, and acceptance criteria.